5. Revoke the grant and verify denial.
6. Test offline and reconnect without duplicated execution.
Journey H — Recovery
1. Interrupt an import, a model download and a sandbox job.
2. Restart relevant services.
3. Verify resumable operations recover safely.
4. Verify non-idempotent side effects are not replayed blindly.
5. Restore a backup to a clean environment.
